CASH FORECAST SUMMARY:
Closing cash falls from the Q4 peak of 26.52 million in December to a low of 20.02 million in April 2027 as stock for the spring season is bought.
External financing of 5.5 million (3.0 million in March, 2.5 million in April) is needed to keep closing cash above the 20 million minimum liquidity floor, the same minimum balance treasury forecasts against.
